title: Agent sessions beside the editor
session_cwd: ~/tour
flow: Agent sessions live in panes next to your code: the SESSIONS rail lists them, a new one opens in a split, and the sessions table shows every session with its state, tokens and cost (the session is a recording stand-in; no model runs).
open src/main.zig
until "fn main"
record
wait 200
run view.activity_sessions
wait 600
run ai.claude_code_new_right
until "agent session" 4000
wait 700
run sessions.table
wait 600
keys @350 down down
poster
key esc
wait 400
run view.focus_left
until "Both tests pass." 8000
wait 500
